OL,3,GNEWSASex, lies and police spies: The
OL,4,Adisputed story of the 'creepy'
OL,5,Aundercover officer
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndrew Coles sings in a church choir,
OL,8,Fis active in local Conservative
OL,9,Fpolitics and was once an undercover
OL,10,FMetropolitan Police officer ` a
OL,11,Fso-called "spy cop".
OL,13,FJessica ` not her real name ` is an
OL,14,Fanimal rights activist who says he
OL,15,Fdeceived her into sleeping with him.
OL,17,FThis is a story about sex and lies. But
OL,18,Fwho is telling the truth?
OL,20,FColes, 66, lives in a thatched cottage
OL,21,Fin the Cambridgeshire countryside with
OL,22,Fhis wife and their greyhound.
